WEBVTT

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:03.480
I am the one you've been looking for.

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:05.480
You're the witch?

00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:08.870
People do seem to call me that.

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:17.120
I'm Senri Akane, a third-year.

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:18.870
I-It's a pleasure.

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:22.320
You don't look very surprised.

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:24.760
And here I thought I was
putting on quite the show.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.060
W-Well...

00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:34.130
The thing is, I saw something
pretty ridiculous on the way here.

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:37.640
What did you see, exactly?

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:42.670
Mysterious, talking creatures,

00:00:42.670 --> 00:00:44.320
and a ridiculously massive monster.

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:46.650
A ribbon-clad ghost, too?

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:50.480
Wow!

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:52.780
Witches are pretty high-tech
these days, huh?

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:53.630
Huh?

00:00:54.010 --> 00:00:55.840
This is an FPS.

00:00:55.840 --> 00:00:57.240
Play it later!

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:01.800
Allow me to get right to the point.

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:03.860
You're pretty much screwed.

00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:07.530
If this keeps up,

00:01:07.530 --> 00:01:10.300
you could have UFOs coming for you
as soon as tomorrow.

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:14.400
Hey, I'm serious here!

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:15.980
Please don't mock me!

00:01:21.120 --> 00:01:22.790
I saw your questionnaire.

00:01:23.430 --> 00:01:24.960
Oh, that.

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:26.770
This final question...

00:01:27.190 --> 00:01:29.490
It's an intriguing answer,

00:01:28.940 --> 00:01:32.190
You have power, and are discontent with this world. Tell me, 
do you wish to change this world? Or do you wish to change yourself?

00:01:28.940 --> 00:01:32.190
(1)The World (2) Myself

00:01:29.490 --> 00:01:31.830
but did you take it seriously 
when you answered?

00:01:32.370 --> 00:01:36.820
Wasn't that the one about
changing the world or myself?

00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:38.720
I did, more or less.

00:01:38.720 --> 00:01:39.640
Did you?

00:01:40.520 --> 00:01:41.430
Um...

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:43.840
If you can, I'd like you to 
deal with this right away!

00:01:43.840 --> 00:01:46.360
I'm one step away from
 being cursed to death!

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:49.630
I'll give you a charm, then.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:52.240
I guess this will do.

00:01:52.240 --> 00:01:53.340
"I guess"?

00:01:54.220 --> 00:01:56.300
I hereby bestow upon you
 the Amulet of Venus,

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:59.230
within which dwells the magical 
energies of the universe.

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:02.440
It's a paperclip!

00:02:02.440 --> 00:02:03.940
A <i>paperclip</i>!

00:02:03.940 --> 00:02:05.600
You're awfully hung up on its form.

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:08.100
Take these with you, too, then.

00:02:08.430 --> 00:02:09.580
They're shikigami.

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:11.580
What are you, an onmyouji?

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:14.060
You won't have any complaints
as long as they work, right?

00:02:14.060 --> 00:02:15.160
I guess...

00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:18.240
However, we will need to schedule 
follow-up appointments.

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:20.070
For that reason,

00:02:20.070 --> 00:02:23.240
I'll have you join the occult research club.

00:02:23.550 --> 00:02:24.320
Huh?

00:03:55.880 --> 00:04:00.510
Episode 2: "Where Youth Begins"

00:03:57.950 --> 00:03:59.000
Where am I?

00:03:59.940 --> 00:04:01.250
Tennouji-san.

00:04:04.130 --> 00:04:05.720
Who are you?

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:08.440
I'm Tomoko, a shikigami.

00:04:08.440 --> 00:04:12.340
I've appeared in your dream as 
a wraith in order to protect you.

00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:13.140
For real?

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:14.990
The enemy is powerful.

00:04:14.990 --> 00:04:17.930
I don't know how long I can
oppose her with my strength.

00:04:18.410 --> 00:04:19.880
But don't worry!

00:04:19.880 --> 00:04:21.650
I'll definitely protect you!

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:24.890
Thank you, Tomoko!

00:04:24.890 --> 00:04:25.900
If...

00:04:28.520 --> 00:04:30.080
If we find peace...

00:04:30.880 --> 00:04:33.970
I want you to go on a date with me!

00:04:38.140 --> 00:04:39.420
Okay!

00:05:10.360 --> 00:05:12.050
Tomoko...

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:18.460
What about the ghost?!

00:05:19.710 --> 00:05:22.210
Tomoko!

00:05:30.870 --> 00:05:33.470
What in the world was that?

00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:43.840
Morning, Kotarou-kun.

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:46.360
What's the matter?

00:05:47.040 --> 00:05:48.420
Kotori, listen to me.

00:05:48.420 --> 00:05:49.290
Last night,

00:05:49.290 --> 00:05:52.250
I entered a different realm from 
the basement storage area.

00:05:52.570 --> 00:05:54.340
Like one of those
"seven school mysteries" things?

00:05:54.340 --> 00:05:55.370
I believe so.

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:58.740
There, I met small, talking creatures,

00:05:58.740 --> 00:06:00.240
a stupidly massive monster,

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:03.250
and a ribbon-wearing ghost 
that kept chasing me.

00:06:03.440 --> 00:06:05.590
Then, the massive monster and ribbon ghost

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:07.260
suddenly started fighting each other!

00:06:07.730 --> 00:06:08.620
And then...

00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:13.680
You shouldn't talk about things 
like this out in public.

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:16.430
Kotori, Kotarou, good morning.

00:06:16.430 --> 00:06:18.580
Oh, Chi-chan, morning.

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:19.570
Ohtori...

00:06:20.200 --> 00:06:21.230
Watch out.

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:23.440
This school is full of danger.

00:06:24.970 --> 00:06:27.190
I don't really understand...

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:32.560
Everyone's treating me like I'm crazy.

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:38.960
Special Offer

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:38.960
<b>Free of Charge</b>

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:38.960
It's delicious!

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:38.960
<b>Feecof</b>

00:06:36.140 --> 00:06:38.960
It may be free, but it tastes terrible.

00:06:39.490 --> 00:06:41.600
Still, for the sake of this mission,

00:06:41.600 --> 00:06:44.770
I must save as much lunch money as I can.

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:52.430
What's the idea?

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:55.120
This is from the customer over there.

00:06:55.700 --> 00:06:56.760
Don't sweat it.

00:06:56.760 --> 00:06:57.680
It's on me!

00:06:57.870 --> 00:06:58.970
Don't screw with me.

00:06:58.970 --> 00:07:00.810
I bet you poisoned it or something!

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:04.900
<i>Perceptive jerk.</i>

00:07:06.120 --> 00:07:08.940
I see straight through your tricks!

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:15.140
Hey, are you implying
I would stoop to such depths?

00:07:15.140 --> 00:07:17.330
Why don't <i>you</i> eat it, then?

00:07:17.610 --> 00:07:18.390
What's wrong?

00:07:18.390 --> 00:07:19.830
Can't eat it? Huh?!

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:23.560
All right, I'll dig in!

00:07:28.860 --> 00:07:30.630
Huh? It's sweet?

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:32.140
It shouldn't be...

00:07:32.910 --> 00:07:35.220
<i>Don't tell me they got switched?!</i>

00:07:38.360 --> 00:07:42.030
That's the one-day-only,
deluxe fruit parfait for you.

00:07:42.030 --> 00:07:43.660
It smells fantastic.

00:07:43.660 --> 00:07:46.180
I bet it's going to be sweet and delicious.

00:07:46.180 --> 00:07:47.730
Better dig in!

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:49.260
Wait!

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:52.160
D-Do you need something,
Tennouji Kotarou?

00:07:52.160 --> 00:07:53.740
N-No, not really.

00:07:54.110 --> 00:07:56.820
Having someone stare at me
during lunch is really unpleasant.

00:07:56.820 --> 00:07:58.020
Turn around!

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:10.380
I-Is my eating a parfait that strange?

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:13.260
N-No, not at all.

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:15.140
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:16.390
<i>I've got no choice!</i>

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:18.980
Hey, what're you doing?!

00:08:27.220 --> 00:08:28.900
My half-eaten...

00:08:30.270 --> 00:08:32.390
Filthy, filthy, filthy!

00:08:32.390 --> 00:08:34.530
Pervert, pervert, pervert!

00:08:34.760 --> 00:08:36.410
No, it's not what you think──

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:38.270
Die, you pervert!

00:08:38.270 --> 00:08:42.220
Beast! Enemy of women!

00:08:57.600 --> 00:08:58.930
Pathetic!

00:09:00.920 --> 00:09:02.270
Ow...

00:09:02.650 --> 00:09:05.480
Damn, the class rep could 
go a little easier on me...

00:09:08.120 --> 00:09:10.980
Hey, Shizu, my girl.

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:17.660
She's asleep?

00:09:27.660 --> 00:09:29.900
Lunch time is almost over.

00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:31.570
Maybe I should wake her up?

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:37.560
What <i>was</i> that alarm?!

00:09:37.560 --> 00:09:39.100
Oh, Kotarou!

00:09:39.100 --> 00:09:41.090
Do you always sleep here?

00:09:41.090 --> 00:09:42.600
Not always.

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:44.810
Just on days with good weather,
if I feel like it.

00:09:45.250 --> 00:09:46.460
I like this spot.

00:09:46.460 --> 00:09:47.980
It's peaceful, calming,

00:09:48.300 --> 00:09:50.250
and you can hear the birds sing
and people talk.

00:09:50.250 --> 00:09:51.690
There are all sorts of sounds.

00:09:52.030 --> 00:09:53.940
So it's your favorite spot?

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:56.460
We should be heading back.

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:02.080
Sneak, sneak...

00:10:06.640 --> 00:10:07.700
Huh?

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:14.090
Gotcha, Shizuru-chan!

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:18.090
Oh? So it did the trick?

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:20.060
Talk about a big surprise.

00:10:22.490 --> 00:10:23.970
Tomoko!

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:28.940
What do you think you're doing?!

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:30.760
After she put her life on the line for me...

00:10:30.760 --> 00:10:33.180
Isn't it great that this trashy 
scrap of paper I had lying around

00:10:33.180 --> 00:10:36.030
was more effective than expected?

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:40.920
Well, there are two left, so you
should be okay for two more nights.

00:10:41.500 --> 00:10:43.620
Um, President.

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:44.240
What?

00:10:44.420 --> 00:10:47.500
You're kind of mocking 
the occult, aren't you?

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:49.550
You're right.

00:10:49.550 --> 00:10:52.280
I hate people who make a fuss about

00:10:52.280 --> 00:10:55.000
magic and superpowers 
in a bid to escape reality.

00:10:55.270 --> 00:10:57.980
This is the occult research club, right?

00:10:57.980 --> 00:10:59.040
It is.

00:10:59.040 --> 00:11:00.480
What do our activities include?

00:11:00.480 --> 00:11:02.350
We don't do anything in particular.

00:11:02.350 --> 00:11:03.710
Even though you have a club room?

00:11:03.710 --> 00:11:05.140
It's just a private room.

00:11:05.380 --> 00:11:06.930
I simply took over this research club

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:09.640
that was on the verge of being dissolved 
because I wanted its club room.

00:11:10.220 --> 00:11:11.830
So, President,

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:14.770
you don't believe in the paranormal
activity I'm experiencing,

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:18.250
or the monster I talked 
to you about yesterday?

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:20.250
Yes, although I'm sure 
something must have happened

00:11:20.250 --> 00:11:22.800
for you to perceive it that way.

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:24.990
Understood.

00:11:26.060 --> 00:11:29.290
Then let's investigate the occult
to see who's right!

00:11:29.620 --> 00:11:30.770
Investigate it?

00:11:30.770 --> 00:11:31.940
This be the occult club.

00:11:31.940 --> 00:11:32.840
You be the witch.

00:11:32.840 --> 00:11:34.290
And I be the scrub

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:35.820
facing a paranormal glitch!

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:37.860
Everything's come together.

00:11:37.860 --> 00:11:40.510
I don't like games like that.

00:11:40.510 --> 00:11:42.680
If that's what you want to do,
knock yourself out.

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:45.220
You look convinced that you've already won.

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:49.310
I admit that there are natural phenomena
yet to be explained by science.

00:11:49.310 --> 00:11:52.940
However, spirits and superpowers
are closer to concepts of blind faith.

00:11:53.700 --> 00:11:56.740
No, superpowers do exist.

00:11:56.740 --> 00:11:58.070
That's absolutely certain.

00:11:58.500 --> 00:12:00.270
How can you be so sure?

00:12:00.580 --> 00:12:02.820
Do you have superpowers?

00:12:02.820 --> 00:12:05.160
N-No, of course not!

00:12:06.670 --> 00:12:08.470
What's with the strange reaction?

00:12:08.470 --> 00:12:09.710
A-Anyway!

00:12:09.710 --> 00:12:12.090
I'll bring you some sort of proof,

00:12:12.090 --> 00:12:15.330
so please look into spirit 
countermeasures on your end!

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:16.330
Got it.

00:12:17.010 --> 00:12:20.270
So, if you <i>are</i> able to prove

00:12:20.270 --> 00:12:22.240
that paranormal phenomena exist...

00:12:22.240 --> 00:12:24.340
Okay, do you have any requests?

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:25.550
Requests?

00:12:25.930 --> 00:12:27.140
Requests...

00:12:27.940 --> 00:12:29.350
Then, let me...

00:12:30.740 --> 00:12:31.620
Let you?

00:12:35.820 --> 00:12:37.860
Let me touch your boobs!

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:42.020
<i>A groper! Call the cops!</i>

00:12:42.020 --> 00:12:42.980
<i>You're going to prison!</i>

00:12:42.980 --> 00:12:44.610
<i>A groper! Call the cops!</i>

00:12:47.060 --> 00:12:48.950
You're the one who told me
to make a request!

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:49.620
Fine.

00:12:50.190 --> 00:12:51.040
Huh?

00:12:51.570 --> 00:12:54.810
If you can prove that 
paranormal phenomena exist,

00:12:54.810 --> 00:12:57.540
you can do obscene things to me.

00:12:57.870 --> 00:12:58.790
Seriously?

00:12:59.270 --> 00:13:02.240
It's impossible anyway, so I don't mind.

00:13:34.780 --> 00:13:36.280
Tomoko!

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:39.830
I'd like to get her to help me.

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:40.460
Who is she?

00:13:40.970 --> 00:13:42.740
She's in my class, and we go way back.

00:13:42.740 --> 00:13:44.560
Kotarou-kun, what's all this about?

00:13:44.560 --> 00:13:47.050
In return for getting help
with my ghost troubles,

00:13:47.050 --> 00:13:48.860
I joined the occult club.

00:13:48.860 --> 00:13:52.980
So, I need to prove that 
paranormal phenomena exist.

00:13:52.980 --> 00:13:54.160
As part of your club activities?

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:55.930
Yes, that's it exactly.

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:58.720
Not going to mention the part 
about touching my breasts?

00:13:59.380 --> 00:14:00.480
Breasts?

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:02.230
No, um...

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:05.240
You're... going to touch... her breasts?

00:14:05.240 --> 00:14:07.760
Well, not breasts, exactly. 
Just the gap in between.

00:14:07.760 --> 00:14:08.710
Nothing erotic about it!

00:14:08.710 --> 00:14:09.840
Was that it?

00:14:09.840 --> 00:14:10.890
Are you okay with that?

00:14:10.890 --> 00:14:11.910
Of course not!

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:12.850
Which is it?!

00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:15.500
You made such a pervy promise?

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:18.230
Look, it was just a joke.

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:21.440
This girl has money and power.

00:14:21.440 --> 00:14:23.660
It can't hurt to get closer to her.

00:14:24.160 --> 00:14:25.220
Dark!

00:14:25.220 --> 00:14:27.630
Plotting to use another person like that...

00:14:28.810 --> 00:14:30.060
Sounds good to me.

00:14:30.060 --> 00:14:33.780
I think this suits you better than
those other, legitimate clubs.

00:14:33.780 --> 00:14:35.670
I don't mind helping out.

00:14:35.670 --> 00:14:37.020
You heard her!

00:14:38.090 --> 00:14:39.770
Do whatever you want.

00:14:40.860 --> 00:14:41.520
All right!

00:14:41.520 --> 00:14:45.280
<b>The Occult Research Club
Welcomes You</b>

00:14:41.920 --> 00:14:44.170
Our occult club blog is up and running.

00:14:44.170 --> 00:14:45.280
Hooray!

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:48.460
First comes the introduction 
and submission form...

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:51.210
This ought to jump start our activities!

00:14:51.760 --> 00:14:53.190
Hello!

00:14:53.190 --> 00:14:54.030
Ack!

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:55.790
Why are you here, Kotarou?

00:14:56.030 --> 00:14:59.250
I could ask you why you <i>haven't</i> been here.

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:01.990
W-Well, um...

00:15:01.990 --> 00:15:03.750
Are you a member of the occult club, too?

00:15:03.970 --> 00:15:07.040
Um, yes, I probably am.

00:15:07.040 --> 00:15:09.900
I have a few ties to Akane-san.

00:15:12.920 --> 00:15:14.830
President...

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:17.360
Boobs...

00:15:39.420 --> 00:15:40.230
<i>Crap!</i>

00:15:40.230 --> 00:15:41.410
<i>I'm out of shikigami!</i>

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:42.520
W-Wait.

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:45.210
I groped a ghost?

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:46.130
They were soft?

00:15:46.130 --> 00:15:46.920
No!

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:51.380
H-Hold on!

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:53.580
Um!

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:01.840
That's the spot!

00:16:02.880 --> 00:16:06.380
Um, have you come up with those
spirit countermeasures yet?

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:07.890
Relax.

00:16:08.160 --> 00:16:11.280
I found some additional shikigami 
and put them in storage for later.

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:12.700
Huh? Wh-Where?

00:16:16.590 --> 00:16:18.200
Man.

00:16:18.460 --> 00:16:20.560
They haven't lost their
 exorcising powers, right?

00:16:20.560 --> 00:16:22.710
Hi, Tennouji-kun.

00:16:24.300 --> 00:16:26.460
Inoue, from the newspaper club?

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:29.140
I hear you joined the occult research club?

00:16:29.140 --> 00:16:31.500
You have <i>really</i> sharp ears, don't you?

00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:34.690
So, I also hear you're investigating 
the mysteries of Kazamatsuri?

00:16:34.690 --> 00:16:35.570
Yeah.

00:16:35.570 --> 00:16:37.510
Just some stuff about paranormal phenomena.

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:39.140
That makes you my rival.

00:16:39.140 --> 00:16:41.940
Let's play fair and square, and see
who can get the biggest scoop!

00:16:41.940 --> 00:16:42.980
What's with that?

00:16:43.700 --> 00:16:47.230
I'm looking forward to the reborn 
occult club's future exploits!

00:16:49.060 --> 00:16:51.380
